<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>It's so fine</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Mckenna Grace</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">It's so fine</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0BI04Da7YLU10A36jlirJd</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.879" end="00:04.938">Got tired eyes from counting signs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:04.938" end="00:09.740">I make them up for myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.740" end="00:11.746">I ignore the ones</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.746" end="00:13.753">That don't fit my desires</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.753" end="00:17.015">Like I'm too good to take help</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.015" end="00:20.774">Never was the type to get high, I just get down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.774" end="00:25.108">Staying in, losing friends and breaking out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.108" end="00:33.108">Try to keep it out of my mind, but there's no doubt, Mm-mm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.707" end="00:35.465">It's all I ever think about</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.465" end="00:37.477">I care, and I'm so kind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.477" end="00:39.790">Tiptoe the finest line</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.790" end="00:44.066">It's been growing all my life, oh-oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.066" end="00:46.141">The pressure on my spine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.141" end="00:48.428">To win love like it's a prize</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.428" end="00:53.199">I say it all the time, but really it's so fine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.199" end="00:56.956">Didn't wanna talk about it, I don't wanna cry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.956" end="01:01.722">Didn't wanna think about it, I don't have the time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.722" end="01:03.995">I think it's coming up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.995" end="01:06.251">I'll push it to the ground</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.251" end="01:10.520">Bury it with sealed lips</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.520" end="01:12.527">Now I'm on the run</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.527" end="01:14.783">Not scared 'cause I'm too proud</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.783" end="01:18.045">Hold everything like a secret</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.045" end="01:21.819">Never was the type to get high, I just get down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.819" end="01:26.385">Haunted by the mistakes that leave my mouth</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.385" end="01:34.162">Try to keep it out of my mind, but there's no doubt, oh-oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.162" end="01:36.252">It's all I ever think about</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.252" end="01:38.584">I care, and I'm so kind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.584" end="01:40.871">Tiptoe the finest line</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.871" end="01:45.132">It's been growing all my life, oh-oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.132" end="01:47.145">The pressure on my spine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.145" end="01:49.404">To win love like it's a prize</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.404" end="01:53.988">I say it all the time, but really it's so fine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.988" end="01:57.997">Didn't wanna talk about it, I don't wanna cry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.997" end="02:02.512">Didn't wanna think about it, I don't have the time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.512" end="02:06.775">Didn't wanna talk about it, I don't wanna cry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.775" end="02:11.542">Didn't wanna think about it, I don't have the time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.542" end="02:13.794">I'm so perfectly fine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.794" end="02:16.330">The sun always shines</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.330" end="02:19.839">My makeup don't run when I cry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.839" end="02:22.676">God, I'm so in my prime</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.676" end="02:24.440">Do everything all the time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.440" end="02:28.769">I won't even sleep when I die</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.769" end="02:31.029">I care, and I'm so kind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.029" end="02:33.291">Tiptoe the finest line</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.291" end="02:37.556">It's been growing all my life, oh-oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.556" end="02:39.564">The pressure on my spine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.564" end="02:41.871">To win love like it's a prize</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.871" end="02:46.386">I say it all the time, but really it's so fine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.386" end="02:50.403">Didn't wanna talk about it, I don't wanna cry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.403" end="02:54.403">Didn't wanna think about it, I don't have the time</p></div></body></tt>